// Package database opens the PostgreSQL connection pool and applies schema
// migrations.
//
// Migrations are plain SQL files in migrations/, embedded into the binary and
// applied by goose on every start (spec §3.7: upgrades never need manual
// SQL). Start reading at [Open] and [Migrate]. Queries themselves live in
// each feature's store package and are generated by sqlc from the same
// migration files.
package database
